ercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le15ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi:</span>\t\tHow are you coming along with the media kit for the book? It has to be done quickly due to the looming release date next week.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam:</span>  \t\tYes. It will be ready. I had never done one before so I did some research and looked at lots of examples. It was so interesting that I'd like to focus on writing media kits.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi:</span>  \t\tI've never done one either. What do you put in it?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam:</span>  \t\tWell, first you write an introduction of who you are, in this case the author and the title of the book. Next you can include a mission or manifesto to differentiate your business or product from the competition and explaining what the business stands for. I put in a statement about what the publisher stands for.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le15ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "35500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi:</span>\t\tYes, sometimes it's hard to stand out in this industry, owing to the volume of competition.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam:</span>  \t\tThe small publishers sometimes get overlooked because of the ubiquity of the large ones. We have to get noticed somehow. Next I put in some factual information about the product, our book. I described the content, illustrations, why it was written and who it was written for.\nI added in a couple illustrations so people can see how beautiful they are. Next you should put in some testimonials or quotes from people saying how great they think the product is. Once I get some testimonials from other authors saying that they love the book, I'll add those in. Testimonials are so influential that I'd like to try to get five in our media kit.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le15ob05re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "80200", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi:</span> \t\tSounds great Adam! So is that the last part?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam:</span>  \t\tYeah. I still need to add in the testimonials and then the last section is the price list and contact information for bookstores, libraries or schools that want to order the book from the publisher. It needs to be in PDF form, so converting to PDF is the last step.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi:</span>  \t\tI'm looking forward to seeing the finished product.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le15ob05re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le15ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le15ob05re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}